+/**
+ * G10-PANEL — THE SERVED `frontGate` ON A TRUE PANEL, IN THIS ENGINE (pass 8, registry-v7 §2.7a).
+ * The driven clock above is a timer and jitters, so it cannot stand for a vsync-quantised panel.
+ * This row loads the served tree's own module (the dev server's graph, no copy) and drives it with
