+        // in `scriptWrites` only, so this, the estate's SECOND setProperty reader, read CTRL-FACE's
+        // `put(name, v)` publisher as an UNRESOLVED write of every token (lint:bands B3 red on the
+        // measured fit at GameControlPanel.vue). One class, every reader (registry-v7 §2.5): a
+        // parameter resolved at ALL-literal call sites names its tokens; any computed call site
+        // keeps the write UNRESOLVED.
